20
00:00:25,503 --> 00:00:26,390
Vamos aplicar.

21
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,246
Um texto diz:

22
00:00:27,276 --> 00:00:27,931
Pasé un rato en la

23
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:29,440
