28
00:00:35,547 --> 00:00:36,574
Mas a frase diz:

29
00:00:36,604 --> 00:00:38,025
passei um tempo no escritório

30
00:00:38,055 --> 00:00:39,831
e depois comi algo delicioso.

31
00:00:39,948 --> 00:00:40,724
O bizu:

32
00:00:40,842 --> 00:00:41,682
em espanhol,

33
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:43,296
desconfie da palavra que parece

34
00:00:43,326 --> 00:00:43,917
igual.

35
00:00:43,976 --> 00:00:45,467
Salva esse bizu e segue

36
00:00:45,497 --> 00:00:46,959
o Bizu do Enem.
